  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction Sphere (Retributive Blast)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> When you use Retributive Blast, you may spend an additional spell point to apply one of the following effects or two additional spell points to apply both effects.</p>\n<p><em>Dissuading Blast:</em> Once per round, when a creature which has been damaged by your retributive blast since the start of their last turn misses you with a melee or melee touch attack, that creature takes the retributive blast’s damage a second time.<br>\n<em>Vengeful Blast:</em> You may use retributive blast when a creature hits you with a melee attack in addition to when it misses you.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/combat-feats#toc35\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
